      "text": "[5:38p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good as you leave Oshodi underneath the bridge inwards Brown intersection, Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport Bus Stop, and then a bit slow due to the funneling of traffic inwards National and up the Ikeja Overpass descending to Ajayi Farm.\n\nMoving on to Ile ZIk is all good.\n\nOur Men are well postitioned to ensure traffic is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
